    "description": {
      "content": "The Duo Admin API provides programmatic access to the administrative functionality of Duo Security for managing users, groups, phones, hardware tokens, WebAuthn credentials, integrations, and bypass codes. Requests are authenticated using HMAC-SHA1 signed HTTP Basic credentials derived from your integration key and secret key.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Duo Security",
